    "notes": "Encoded in its real meter, 3/4, quarter-note pulse (3 beats per bar, one quarter per beat). Carries the four-bar accompaniment vamp (the Gmaj7/Dmaj7 alternation, one chord per bar) and the complete first melody phrase, which enters over Gmaj7 and parks on a long F# over the continuing vamp. The answering second phrase and the closing cadence are deliberately NOT carried rather than risk an inaccurate reconstruction. Melody and changes only; the piece has no lyrics."
